BT 0.11 0.11 0.12 rg /F1 8.8 Tf 226.0 593.0 Td (- Left 45-deg lap joint + 0.35 mm micro-detent CLICK flush) Tj ET
BT 0.11 0.11 0.12 rg /F1 8.8 Tf 226.0 580.0 Td (- Right 1.80 mm snap arm CLICKS into Part_B_Lower's catch) Tj ET
BT 0.11 0.11 0.12 rg /F1 8.8 Tf 226.0 567.0 Td (- Top-right detent snap tab CLICKS over the monitor corner) Tj ET
