BT 0.11 0.11 0.12 rg /F1 9 Tf 56.0 417.0 Td (and the thin bottom-right edge tucked under the 2.0 mm rear retaining lip.) Tj ET
BT 0.11 0.11 0.12 rg /F2 9.5 Tf 46.0 397.0 Td (Step 5: Slide Part_B_Upper Straight Down \(-Y\) Until Both Sides Lock) Tj ET
